{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stranded beneath three silent moons, you must survive, explore, and uncover their mystery\u2014guided by fragmented messages from Command and the choices you make along the way.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Mission Brief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>EN-##</strong>, a robotic unit deployed to the surface of an uncharted alien planet.<br>You crashed during atmospheric entry. Your systems are damaged, but functional.<br>Your mission parameters are active but incomplete. Survival is essential. Purpose is uncertain.<br>Contact with Command is active\u2014but fragmented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command guides you through your mission, offering instructions and objectives.<br><strong>Will you follow its directives, or choose your own path?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbiting above are three silent moons</strong>, watching a world scarred by volatile weather and abandoned infrastructure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Gather. Upgrade. Survive. Explore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Three Moons</i> is built around a focused survival-exploration loop driven by resource management and system upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b Manage your battery</strong>, which powers all core functions. Energy is limited and essential to survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Gather resources</strong> from the environment to recharge your battery and craft module updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Install modules</strong> recovered from scattered crash crates to unlock new abilities that enhance survival and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 Deploy a resource-gathering drone</strong> to assist in collecting materials more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf29\ufe0f Adapt to environmental hazards</strong>, including unpredictable weather and roaming surveillance drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce1 Connect with an orbital satellite</strong> to request limited support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore the terrain</strong> to locate additional modules, logs, and resources that expand your systems and shape your path forward</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663790?t=1771879314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663790/c8b6d0ff3072cff09ae07d6f50bb73a6a14cdd41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771879314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663790/49b107a3dc5aa377f1a942cc161c4c2bdf3a03c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771879314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663790/49b107a3dc5aa377f1a942cc161c4c2bdf3a03c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771879314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4074130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stranded beneath three silent moons, you must survive, explore, and uncover their mystery\u2014guided by fragmented messages from Command and the choices you make along the way.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Mission Brief</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>EN-##</strong>, a robotic unit deployed to the surface of an uncharted alien planet.<br>You crashed during atmospheric entry. Your systems are damaged, but functional.<br>Your mission parameters are active but incomplete. Survival is essential. Purpose is uncertain.<br>Contact with Command is active\u2014but fragmented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command guides you through your mission, offering instructions and objectives.<br><strong>Will you follow its directives, or choose your own path?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbiting above are three silent moons</strong>, watching a world scarred by volatile weather and abandoned infrastructure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Gather. Upgrade. Survive. Explore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Three Moons</i> is built around a focused survival-exploration loop driven by resource management and system upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b Manage your battery</strong>, which powers all core functions. Energy is limited and essential to survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Gather resources</strong> from the environment to recharge your battery and craft module updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Install modules</strong> recovered from scattered crash crates to unlock new abilities that enhance survival and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 Deploy a resource-gathering drone</strong> to assist in collecting materials more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf29\ufe0f Adapt to environmental hazards</strong>, including unpredictable weather and roaming surveillance drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce1 Connect with an orbital satellite</strong> to request limited support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore the terrain</strong> to locate additional modules, logs, and resources that expand your systems and shape your path forward</p></li></ul>","developers":["Beyond Aether Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663790/72d5f8e61008342a0c2c56f005fabdfd0abf51e4/header.jpg?t=1771879314","is_fre